<title>HUNGARY: Hungary c.bank cuts six-mth, 12-mth depo rates.</title>
<headline>Hungary c.bank cuts six-mth, 12-mth depo rates.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Hungary said on Friday that it cut its six-month deposit interest rate to 20.50 percent from 21.00 percent and the 12-month deposit interest rate to 20.25 percent from 20.50 percent.</p>
<p>The decision is effective immediately.</p>
<p>&quot;The rate cut was made possible by a decline in inflation and favourable processes on the capital market,&quot; the central bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
